msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Oh, hello, dearest Michel!⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫What brings you "
"here so late?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Did you come to see me?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Oh, salut, mon cher Michel !⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Qu’est-ce qui "
"t’amène si tard ?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫T’es venu me voir ?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_FF351DA8_8779_4767_BA76_C1FC25BF8E79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2f6ad3a449c4366901a4c9ed7574ba6a01ec42cf9a1bbc398ef883a19727d67
#. default-sha256: 863c359b9e9bc07be65ae55ea2afc7e8b54261dfa0564a787e3c4d6a894610c2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FF351DA8_8779_4767_BA76_C1FC25BF8E79"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ooh, it’s a strange lady!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And she’s wearing almost nothing!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Are you "
"not cold in that?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ouh, y a une dame bizarre !⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Et elle porte presque rien !⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫T’as pas "
"froid comme ça ?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7B29FB6B_EDF6_4311_A878_343A9A533E18
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a82b2e6dbfbc4521e33470f8d73a2470b4782cabcd975ebffdab38f1febaa44
#. default-sha256: 0291dcdf9dbf60514d0a9a5a7b2de91df5fcdd3369cb19c224c935e5a1392897
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7B29FB6B_EDF6_4311_A878_343A9A533E18"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Girl, you don’t make it in this business worryin’ about the cold."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je vais te dire, ma petiote, tu t’en sors pas dans mon métier si tu t’en fais pour le "
"froid."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0CA5D20A_D745_4C59_9A3A_F67155200AC1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5981170925e060469b396506b944a274e5c910074cd1ed436a3f476b69e7aa5f
